5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? I'm going to find them for sure! Let's all try our best to figure it out together!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is certainly an intriguing challenge, Rin. However, we should remain cautious. Enthusiasm is wonderful, but we will need a calm and rational approach if we hope to identify the werewolf correctly.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. While Rin's energy is refreshing, we need to be methodical. Let's observe each other's reactions carefully. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they'd like to suggest?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. For now, it's best to listen and observe. Since we have no information yet, I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in how people present themselves as the discussion progresses.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,It seems we're all in agreement on being cautious. I'll be doing the same—watching how you all handle the pressure. Let's see who starts acting out of character first.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is being so serious! It's like you're all in a big meeting. @Victoria, @Mizuki, @Toshio, @Shion, don't be too scary! Maybe we should talk about what we'll do if someone claims to be the Seer?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki"",""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is a practical point, Rin. If someone claims to be the Seer, we must evaluate their timing and the consistency of their information. A premature claim could be a bluff to gain control of the vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. A fake Seer often tries to lead the group too early to avoid scrutiny. I believe we should wait until Day 1 to see if a genuine Seer feels it's safe to reveal themselves or provide a lead.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Mizuki. Revealing the Seer too early makes them an immediate target for the werewolf. It's more logical to gather a bit of data first before making any high-risk claims.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Wait, so we're all just agreeing with Mizuki? How boring. If we're too cautious, we'll just be sitting ducks. I'm curious to see who's actually hiding something behind all this ""logic.""","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so mean! I'm not boring, I'm just excited! But you're right, just agreeing is a bit dull. Maybe the werewolf is the one trying to make everyone act all ""logical"" and quiet?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"That is a possibility, Rin. Often, those who push for a specific atmosphere—whether it be one of extreme caution or forced logic—do so to mask their own intentions. We must be mindful of that.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That's a fair point, Victoria. However, logic is our only tool here. If we abandon it for suspicion alone, we're playing right into the werewolf's hands. Let's keep observing; the truth usually reveals itself through contradictions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. While Rin's theory is interesting, we shouldn't let suspicion replace evidence. I'll be paying close attention to who tries to steer the conversation away from logic when the time comes to make a decision.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you're so predictable. ""Paying close attention"" is just a fancy way of saying you're hiding in the back. I wonder if that caution is actually a shield for someone who's afraid of being questioned.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're always picking on people! You're like a grumpy big brother. I think we should all just be honest! I'm going to keep my eyes wide open and find the bad guy tomorrow! Good luck everyone!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Honesty is a noble goal, Rin, but in this game, it is a luxury we cannot always afford. I will be watching closely as well. Let us see what the first night reveals.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be doing the same. Let's all try to get some rest and stay sharp. I'm looking forward to seeing how the dynamics shift tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll be watching as well. Let's see who the first night targets and what information comes to light. Good night.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I'll be dreaming of all the little slips and mistakes you'll make tomorrow. Try not to be too obvious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
